Introduce support for the HONOR MagicBook Art 14 laptop.
This version is based on the initial work by Kirill A. Korinsky [1]
and Valentin Manea [2].

Supported:

- Sound (with alsa-ucm-conf config [3])
  - Speakers
  - Headphone jack
- Bluetooth
- Battery
- HDMI
- Touchpad
- Keyboard (with backlight)
- Touchscreen
- WiFi
- USB-C ports
- USB-A port
- UFS
- H/W accel
- DP over USB-C

Untested:

- Camera
- Fingerprint reader
- Sleep/Suspend

Broken:

- eDP

