[2]: https://github.com/vamanea/linux-magicbook/blob/x1e80100-magicbook-6.19/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-honor-magicbook-art-14.dts
[3]: https://github.com/alsa-project/alsa-ucm-conf/pull/755

