+	 * Each AVG_IN register read uses two transfers:
+	 *   TX: [reg_hi | 0x80, reg_lo]  (address phase, CS stays asserted)
+	 *   RX: [data_hi, data_lo]       (bpw-wide data phase, storagebits=16)
