 drivers/extcon/Kconfig      |  10 ++
 drivers/extcon/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/extcon/extcon-s2m.c | 345 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 356 insertions(+)

