The count_read()/count_write() callbacks pass a u64 count value, so I
suspect this private count value store can be u64 as well.

> +	u64 ceiling;
> +	bool enabled;
> +	enum counter_count_direction direction;
> +	enum gpio_qenc_function function;
> +
> +	int prev_a;
